Analyze ROOT to understand journey states, cohort boundaries, and available signals. 

Analyze inbox data to identify recurring patient questions and information needs. 

Review available Voice of Customer and call-transcript data, define the minimum viable interfaces, and identify the first analysis questions for each source. 

