Build the chat experience, the two care-companion prototypes, and the initial Voice of Customer, call-transcript, and experiment-results interfaces. 

Connect the prototypes to the agreed data and content patterns. 

Run experiments and evaluate responses against the emerging framework. 

Iterate on the experience based on findings from discovery, insights, and testing. 

Prepare the controlled production evaluation path and capture follow-up work that should move into the next iteration. 

